4n rooli ja selvit\u00e4 ep\u00e4ilytt\u00e4v\u00e4n kahvilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6axc3ypg_MUQ7kNvwHcg_jf&_nc_oc=Adr0bYPifeLu2co1aLR2lX803Ggn9kVGd2tL1oh3QgEtYSEYzyxUnaCfWoOFC4ZgiDg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTEM6q6TNIzSZBJ6_Q7sZCKoIZXhC_N5WmEZ9tDRcwBGg&oe=6AF5F194"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NsauWYsNn34Q7kNvwFmmXN3&_nc_oc=Adq3X9S5PqRSjzJqfChlGhw3MsRKxdWOo9mMZvFwjDxHkxJn-raU7VUd43K-D6x3nM4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSgrafUVANXE1jz3fCaH7n9ivbhe9WV4QrxbyHxZVtkRw&oe=6AF5BE32"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sTyP_ut9ytYQ7kNvwGfjOCn&_nc_oc=AdqimwQrzqDzDRQzgAUelqbSyAiwQndERt6TfLDa2RA7Emk_xyz_eOE4RH-o-beidBo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQANH-TETsjUEOPsHsSqynsQZFIL0QzGHAIrA7xYM05qw&oe=6AF5CBD5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.p